Saga, the ultimate bubble-matching adventure packed with colorful challenges, satisfying combos, and endless fun! Match and crush vibrant bubbles to complete exciting objectives across hundreds of unique levels designed to test your puzzle-solving skills. Use powerful boosters, unlock special bubble effects, and create massive chain reactions to earn high scores and rewards.\n\nWhether you want to relax with casual gameplay or challenge yourself with tricky puzzles, Bubble Crush Saga offers smooth controls, eye-catching visuals, and addictive gameplay for players of all ages. Explore beautiful environments, complete daily challenges, and enjoy nonstop entertainment anytime, anywhere. Get ready to pop, blast, and crush your way to victory in the most fun-filled bubble puzzle adventure!", "short_description": "Match colorful bubbles, create powerful combos, and enjoy endless fun in Bubble Crush Saga! Challenge your skills through exciting levels filled with vibrant effects and addictive gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rixxxstudio/meta-quest-privacy-policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RexxxStudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rixxxstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_m